{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kokoro Clover SUN - Prehistoric Invaders!",
    "steam_appid": 3175530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The second installment in the 2000s era styled anime-themed Kokoro Clover series!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel paired with boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our heroes' next adventure is in...dinosaur times?! This time the bad guys are trying to destroy the future! The only way to fight back is with dino-transformations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175530/extras/b545947ec5a529a6266d005be3389beb.avif?t=1743087449\" data-has-big width=800 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This installment includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5-minute recap of the story so far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Special feature episodes 1-4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6Visual Novel (Story)\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an effort to save a mysterious dinosaur that appears before them, Treffy and her friends travel back in time to the age of dinosaurs! There they encounter a madman bent on destroying the very future they came from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set following the events of Season 1, this title acts as a theatrical release for an anime might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6Boss Battles\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D action designed to be playable by all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gain invincibility by dancing! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6Series Overview\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel series designed to remind players of the joys of Saturday morning cartoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with transformations, cards, dancing, and robots, too! The adventure goes on\u2014forever and always!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story features opening, ending, and commercial interlude animations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment also features an all-in-one theatrical release mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The clock on the top left can be changed to 8:00, 9:00, or whatever time you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features all original music tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pixel art visuals serve to offer real 2000s nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
