transformations, cards, dancing, and robots, too! The adventure goes on\u2014forever and always!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story features opening, ending, and commercial interlude animations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment also features an all-in-one theatrical release mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The clock on the top left can be changed to 8:00, 9:00, or whatever time you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Features all original music tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pixel art visuals serve to offer real 2000s nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
